BUY USER FLOW:
1. User clicks קניית משתמש.
2. User chooses:
   - Discord
   - Roblox
   - Fortnite
3. A form opens with ONE free-text field:
   "מה חשוב לך שיהיה במשתמש?"
4. The user writes the requirements freely.
5. The ticket opens and shows both:
   - selected account type
   - free-text requirements


ANTI LINK:
- antiLinkEnabled: true
- Blocks normal URLs.
- Blocks Discord invite links.
- Blocks GIF URLs from Tenor/Giphy and other URL embeds.
- Staff/Admin bypass.
- Requires Manage Messages.

VERIFY:
- Put Member role ID in memberRoleId.
- Run /setup-verify inside the Verify channel.
- Verify channel stays public and read-only.
- All channels that were public become Member-only.
- Existing private Staff/Admin channels stay private.
- Verify button gives Member instantly, without numbers.

Required:
- Manage Channels
- Manage Roles
- Prime Store Bot role above Member.


STOCK SYSTEM:
Public:
- /stock
- !stock

Staff/Admin:
- /stock-set platform:<Discord/Roblox/Fortnite> amount:<number>

Examples:
- /stock-set platform:Fortnite amount:12
- /stock-set platform:Roblox amount:5
- /stock-set platform:Discord amount:8

Stock data is saved at:
/app/data/stock.json

The Buy User questionnaire also displays the current stock before the user chooses a platform.


TICKET CLAIM DISPLAY:
- When Staff clicks Claim, the main ticket embed shows:
  "🛡️ מטפל בטיקט: @Staff"
- A visible message is also sent:
  "הטיקט נלקח על ידי @Staff"
- When Release is used, the Staff field is removed and the ticket becomes available again.


ANTI-SPAM:
- 6 or more mentions in ONE message:
  deletes the whole message + 1 hour Discord Timeout.
- 6 or more links in ONE message:
  deletes the whole message + 1 hour Discord Timeout.
- Staff/Admin bypass.
- Requires Manage Messages and Moderate Members.
- Bot role must be above users it needs to timeout.
